/*
 * circuit-count.compact — no published maximum circuit count.
 *
 * Official Compact reference (https://docs.midnight.network/compact/reference/compact-reference):
 *   a contract may define several circuits, and at most one constructor.
 *   A circuit that touches the public ledger requires a proof and a proving key.
 * The reference does not state a maximum number of circuits. This file does not invent one.
 *
 * Upstream: midnightntwrk/midnight-docs#1387
 * Kapa could not answer the maximum circuits per contract. This sample has two
 * exported circuits so a count is visible, not because two is a protocol cap.
 *
 * Language pin: Compact ~0.31.1 / language ~0.23.
 * LOCAL-TRUE. Source only. Not compiled here. Not deployed.
 * This file does not fix the public indexer or node.
 *
 * Built by @kshot9000 https://x.com/kshot9000
